    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math>, this is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>form</p><p>Apply&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w